      en: ["The Pallastunturi National Park was originally established in 1938.", "The highest peak in the massif is Taivaskero, reaching 807 meters.", "Sammaltunturi fell is home to a station measuring the world's cleanest air.", "The 1952 Olympic torch for the Helsinki Games was lit on Taivaskero peak.", "The Hetta-Pallas hiking trail is approximately 55 kilometers long.", "The region is located entirely north of the Arctic Circle."],
